      "source_image_index": null,
      "ownership": "unknown"
    },
    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "Thus, his salary should be Rs 16,000. Therefore, in the current year his salary should increase by Rs 10,000 (i.e. Rs 16,000 - Rs 6,000) so as to maintain the same level of living in the current year as that of the base year.",
    "answer_latex": null,
